<title>UK: TABLE-Matthew Clark yr profits fall 4 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Matthew Clark yr profits fall 4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to April 30, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)(pre-exceps) 31.9		  vs  44.4</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 31.9		  vs  18.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  15.0		  vs  15.0</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  24.0		  vs  24.0</p>
<p> Pretax pre-excepts	40.6		  vs  42.3</p>
<p> Pretax			40.6		  vs  17.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   570.7		  vs 450.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 39 and 41 million stg.</p>
<p>Full name of cider maker - Matthew Clark Plc.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
